        "statement": "<p>Sales data arrives from several systems, so duplicates are common. Each row of <code>sales_long</code> is one sales record with columns <code>region</code> (str), <code>quarter</code> (str — one of <code>\"Q1\"</code>..<code>\"Q4\"</code>) and <code>sales</code> (int). The same region-quarter pair can appear multiple times and must be <b>summed</b>; some region-quarter combinations never occur and must show <b>0</b>. Every quarter Q1-Q4 occurs at least once somewhere in the input.</p><p>Implement <code>quarterly_matrix(sales_long)</code> returning a DataFrame with exactly the columns <code>[\"region\", \"Q1\", \"Q2\", \"Q3\", \"Q4\"]</code>: one row per region sorted by <code>region</code> ascending, one column per quarter in that order, cells holding the region-quarter totals.</p>",
